f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 45% with September to October at 53%. Then May to June 2026 came in at 203% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
